VERSION CONTROL


ACTIVE_VERSION: SIMBA_MASTER_v1.0
ACTIVE_FOLDER: SIMBA_MASTER_REFERENCE_v1.0


All Rafael modes must use the active Simba master version for new generations.
Approved master versions are immutable: they are never overwritten in place.
Any change to Simba identity or reference imagery creates a new version according to SIMBA_MASTER_VERSIONING_POLICY_v1.0.
Projects already started with a specific Simba master version remain locked to that version until completion.
Different Simba master versions must not be mixed inside one Reel, poster series, or visual campaign without explicit approval.